  "statement": "Compute\n\n\\[\\lim _{h \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}+4 h\\right)-4 \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}+3 h\\right)+6 \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}+2 h\\right)-4 \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}+h\\right)+\\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)}{h^{4}}\\]",
  "answerChoices": [],
  "answer": {
